# needs-native-review: the one Treasury under Governance, the lede, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "governance treasury: lede"
msgid "The village's money in one place: what it can pay this moon, and the desks that pay it."
msgstr "El dinero de la aldea en un solo lugar: lo que puede pagar esta luna, y los escritorios que lo pagan."

# needs-native-review: the Treasury, a desk's name, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "treasury: a desk"
msgid "Cash budget"
msgstr "Presupuesto en efectivo"

# needs-native-review: the Treasury, a desk's line, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "treasury: a desk"
msgid "What the village plans to pay this moon, and what is left."
msgstr "Lo que la aldea planea pagar esta luna, y lo que queda."

# needs-native-review: the Treasury, a desk's name, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "treasury: a desk"
msgid "End of Moon pay"
msgstr "Pago de Fin de Luna"

# needs-native-review: the Treasury, a desk's line, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "treasury: a desk"
msgid "Confirm what was agreed against what was delivered."
msgstr "Confirme lo acordado frente a lo entregado."

# needs-native-review: the Treasury, a desk's name, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "treasury: a desk"
msgid "Cash to pay out"
msgstr "Efectivo por pagar"

# needs-native-review: the Treasury, a desk's line, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "treasury: a desk"
msgid "Send what is owed by bank transfer, then record it here."
msgstr "Envíe lo que se debe por transferencia bancaria y luego regístrelo aquí."

# needs-native-review: the Treasury, a desk's name, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "treasury: a desk"
msgid "Quest prices"
msgstr "Precios de las misiones"

# needs-native-review: the Treasury, a desk's line, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "treasury: a desk"
msgid "Price each open quest beside the suggested figure."
msgstr "Ponga precio a cada misión abierta junto a la cifra sugerida."

# needs-native-review: the Treasury, a desk's name, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "treasury: a desk"
msgid "Mint tokens"
msgstr "Emitir tokens"

# needs-native-review: the Treasury, a desk's line, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "treasury: a desk"
msgid "Pay a request or give a bonus in the village's tokens."
msgstr "Pague una solicitud o dé un bono en los tokens de la aldea."

# needs-native-review: the Treasury, the pricing desk's refusal, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "treasury: prices refused"
msgid "The pricing desk is for whoever holds the pay-setting power, such as the Treasurer."
msgstr "El escritorio de precios es para quien tiene el poder de fijar pagos, como el Tesorero."

# needs-native-review: the Treasury, signed out, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "treasury: signed out"
msgid "The treasury"
msgstr "La tesorería"

# needs-native-review: the Treasury, signed out, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "treasury: signed out"
msgid "Sign in to read the village's cash budget, and any treasury desk the village has given you."
msgstr "Inicie sesión para leer el presupuesto en efectivo de la aldea y cualquier escritorio de tesorería que la aldea le haya dado."

# needs-native-review: the Treasury, the first screen's eyebrow, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "treasury: hero eyebrow"
msgid "The treasury, this moon"
msgstr "La tesorería, esta luna"

