# needs-native-review: a member's budget suggestion, sent, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "budget suggestion sent"
msgid "Sent. It goes to whoever holds the budget power, or to a village vote when nobody does."
msgstr "Enviada. Va a quien tiene el poder del presupuesto, o a una votación de la aldea cuando nadie lo tiene."

# needs-native-review: a member's budget suggestion, an error, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "budget suggestion error"
msgid "The suggestion was not sent. Try again in a moment."
msgstr "La sugerencia no se envió. Inténtelo de nuevo en un momento."

