msgid "A Treasurer who is not an admin opens this desk under Governance, Treasury"
msgstr "Un Tesorero que no es administrador abre este escritorio en Gobernanza, Tesorería"

# needs-native-review: the Treasury, the desks this reader does not hold, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "treasury: who keeps the books, for a reader without these powers"
msgid "Each opens for whoever holds its power, which the village gives by its vote."
msgstr "Cada uno se abre para quien tiene su poder, que la aldea da por su voto."

# needs-native-review: the budget upload, a line of help, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "budget upload"
msgid "Save the sheet as CSV, or paste its cells below."
msgstr "Guarde la hoja como CSV, o pegue sus celdas abajo."

# needs-native-review: the budget upload, a line of help, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "budget upload"
msgid "The first row names the columns: period, label, category and planned, then circle, role, currency and note if you like."
msgstr "La primera fila nombra las columnas: periodo, etiqueta, categoría y planificado, y luego círculo, rol, moneda y nota si lo desea."

# needs-native-review: the budget upload, a line of help, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "budget upload"
msgid "A period is a moon, a month like 2026-11, a season, or two dates. You read what changes before anything is saved."
msgstr "Un periodo es una luna, un mes como 2026-11, una temporada o dos fechas. Usted lee lo que cambia antes de que se guarde nada."

